  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 ", lesson 15)."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"89af3edc-2802-46ec-bd9e-4644075c3bda"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Regression tests",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": ",
 StyleBox["ProjectionRegression.wl",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " keeps the old projection operator (",
 StyleBox["tests/reference/OldProjection.wl",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 ") only to require that the new one agrees with it (lesson 08)."
